sequenceDiagram
    participant Client as Client
    participant System as Event Listener
    participant Orchestrator as Orchestrator
    participant AI as Vertex AI
    participant Caseworker as Caseworker
    participant Executor as Executor
    participant Doctor as Doctor Office
    participant SMS as SMS Gateway
    
    Client->>System: Texts: "Can't make 2pm appointment"
    System->>System: Detect cancellation event
    System->>Orchestrator: Trigger orchestration
    
    Orchestrator->>Orchestrator: Query full context
    Note over Orchestrator: Check all clients<br/>Documents ready?<br/>Transport compatible?<br/>Higher urgency?
    
    Orchestrator->>AI: Complex decision needed?
    AI->>Orchestrator: Best match: Client B
    
    Orchestrator->>Caseworker: Present recommendation
    Note over Caseworker: Review reasoning<br/>Impact: $120 saved<br/>6 actions planned
    
    Caseworker->>Orchestrator: APPROVE ✓
    
    Orchestrator->>Executor: Execute plan
    
    par Execute all actions
        Executor->>Doctor: Cancel next week
        Executor->>Doctor: Book today 2pm
        Executor->>SMS: Notify Client B
    end
    
    Doctor-->>Executor: Confirmed
    SMS-->>Executor: Sent
    
    Executor->>Caseworker: ✓ Complete (8 seconds)
    
    Note over System,SMS: Total time: 60 seconds<br/>vs 2-4 hours manual

